msgid ""
"Use this method to get the list of backdrops, which can be used as the "
"background of a theme of the screen for sharing a link to a user or a chat. "
"Requires no parameters. Returns a "
":class:`litegram.types.chat_share_theme_backdrops.ChatShareThemeBackdrops` "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Возвращает список фонов для темы экрана отправки ссылки на пользователя или "
"чат. Параметры не требуются. Возвращает объект "
":class:`litegram.types.chat_share_theme_backdrops.ChatShareThemeBackdrops`."

msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#getchatsharethemebackdrops"
msgstr "Источник: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#getchatsharethemebackdrops"

